specs=[
 ['lord.wardship_ended','endingGuardianKind',{'named_guardian'=>'후견인이 기록되어 있던 영주의 후견이 성년과 함께 끝났다.','overlord'=>'상위 영주의 후견 아래 있던 영주가 성년이 되어 후견을 벗어났다.'},'src/engine/lordship.ts:56-72,170-181; src/engine/history.ts:586-600','At successful ending, bind SAME ward lord ID before and after; verify event-year minus birthYear is finite safe integer >=21. Snapshot before.lordship.wardship.guardianId: nonempty string -> named_guardian; null -> overlord by engine convention; missing/invalid unknown. Do not infer mother/kin from role or current state.'],
 ['faction.leader_succeeded','successorHouseholdAtEvent',{'same_household'=>'세상을 떠난 수장과 같은 가구의 사람이 무리를 이었다.','different_household'=>'세상을 떠난 수장과 다른 가구의 사람이 무리를 이었다.'},'src/engine/history.ts:285-294; src/engine/factions.ts:117-149,290-305','Match params predecessorId and leaderId to exact event identities. Require predecessor explicitly dead and successor explicitly alive. Snapshot predecessor householdId from before persons people/past and successor householdId after; both nonempty valid IDs. Equal -> same_household else different_household. No inference of blood kin, hereditary right, rivalry, or motive.'],
