 ['stewardship.began','offMapPortfolioAtStart',{'sole_estate'=>'관리하는 지도 밖 영지가 한 곳인 가운데, 영주가 직접 보고 청지기가 장부를 맡기 시작했다.','multiple_estates'=>'여러 지도 밖 영지를 관리하는 가운데, 이 영지도 영주가 직접 보고 청지기가 장부를 맡기 시작했다.'},'src/engine/stewardship.ts:51-54,117-134; src/engine/history.ts:924-935','At new oversight require after mode=direct, estate offMap=true and titleHolder=possessor=lord, appointed person exists alive=true. Count distinct after oversight estate IDs whose after estates are offMap and held in BOTH title/possession by lord, including this estate. One -> sole_estate, greater than one -> multiple_estates; zero/duplicate/invalid -> unknown. This describes concurrent oversight portfolio only, not lifetime first acquisition. Multiple additions share after snapshot; never invent ordering.']
